In the hybrid combinatorial technique (HCT) \(\Sigma^{*}(1385)\) baryons are identified by combining these topologically reconstructed \(\Lambda\) baryons with \(\pi\) mesons. Figure 4.12 presents the invariant mass spectrum of the \(\Sigma^{*}(1385)\) calculated with the HCT in p+p

